! Elegant FODO -- EXACT scenario. KQUAD (symplectic integrator of the exact quadrupole Hamiltonian,
! N_KICKS high enough to converge to the exact map) + EDRIFT (exact, non-paraxial drift) -- the same
! intended model as the ImpactX reference (ExactQuad + ExactDrift). K1>0 focuses horizontally.
QF: KQUAD, L={{ params.quad_length }}, K1={{ params.k1 }}, N_SLICES=40
D:  EDRIFT, L={{ params.drift_length }}
QD: KQUAD, L={{ params.quad_length }}, K1={{ -params.k1 }}, N_SLICES=40
BL: LINE=(QF, D, QD, D)
